[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice22.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: You did it.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice23.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: Against every expectation… you restored The Hidden Gallery.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice24.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: The halls are no longer silent.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice25.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: The paintings remember who they are.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice26.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: Works once forgotten now stand illuminated once again.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice27.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: Not as relics of the past… but as living pieces of our shared cultural heritage.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice28.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: On behalf of the European Institute of Cultural Preservation, we thank you.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice29.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: Your dedication, curiosity, and perseverance have brought this gallery back to life.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice30.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: Please accept this certificate as recognition of your achievement.

[voice path="res://assets/Sounds/voices/voice31.mp3" volume="-10.0"]
DrEliseMoreau: The doors of The Hidden Gallery will remain open… because of you.
[signal arg="certificate_finished"]